@startuml patient_assignment_workflow
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title MVP patient assignment and delivery — owner decisions 12 October
actor "Operator\n(button / phone browser)" as op
participant "Digital stethoscope\n(no display)" as dev
database "HAPI FHIR server\n(KIS)" as fhir

== 1 · Boot and register ==
dev -> dev : startup checks → Idle
alt no stored Wi-Fi credentials
  dev -> dev : Idle enters Portal, open hotspot
  op -> dev : phone enters Wi-Fi credentials
  dev -> dev : save, close hotspot
end
dev -> dev : join hospital Wi-Fi
note right of dev : connection fails →\nIdle + normal Wi-Fi fault,\noffline listening, no registration
dev -> dev : SNTP time sync
dev -> fhir : GET /Device/{stetho-id}
alt Device absent (404 or 410)
  dev -> fhir : PUT /Device/{stetho-id} (no patient)
else Device present
  fhir --> dev : Device (adopt patient as local assignment)
  dev -> fhir : PATCH metadata only, never patient
end

== 2 · Assign patient (Idle only) ==
op -> dev : long press >= 2 s
dev -> fhir : GET /Patient?_has:Encounter:patient:status=in-progress\n&_elements=name,birthDate,identifier&_count=20
fhir --> dev : Bundle: admitted patients, minimal fields
dev -> dev : leave hospital Wi-Fi,\nopen WPA2 hotspot with timeout
op -> dev : phone joins hotspot, opens portal
dev --> op : name / birth date / ID + list load time
op -> dev : pick and confirm patient
dev -> dev : close hotspot, rejoin hospital Wi-Fi
dev -> fhir : PATCH /Device/{id} patient\nIf-Match: W/"n" (409 → no change)
dev -> fhir : GET /Device/{id} (readback)
note right of dev : mismatch or failure →\nunassigned + normal fault

== 3 · Measure and send ==
op -> dev : Start (no network work)
dev -> dev : freeze local assignment,\nlog assignment present + Device version\n(no patient data)
dev -> dev : listen → BPM (device only)
op -> dev : Stop
dev -> fhir : GET /Device/{id} (pre-send check,\nrecord meta.versionId)
note right of dev : missing or different patient →\nno send + normal fault
dev -> fhir : POST /Observation\nIf-None-Exist: identifier=…|device-boot-session\nsubject + device, LOINC 8867-4, /min,\neffectiveDateTime = interval end
fhir --> dev : 201 created / 200 existing, Location
dev -> fhir : GET /Observation/{id from Location} (readback,\nnumeric comparison)
dev -> fhir : GET /Device/{id} (post-readback recheck)
note right of dev : mismatch, failure or Device\nversionId changed since check →\nUnverified, normal fault, no retry
@enduml
